  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\nAll along the year, the game changes with seasons or certain holidays. It can affect the game's loading screen, the appearance of several items in the game, the background music, the occurrence of special <a href=\"/wiki/events-7210\" title=\"Events\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">events</a> and Easter eggs.\n</p><p>Seasons in the game may start or end at different times over the years. The Hay Day team sometimes follows Finnish seasons, the country where Supercell is located <sup class=\"reference\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Standard theme</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/14/Loading_Screen_Standard.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20161104111322\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Standard loading screen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Standard loading screen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Standard loading screen</figcaption></figure>\n<div></div>\n<p>Farm soundtrack: <span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGame_Soundtrack_Farm.ogg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/File:Game_Soundtrack_Farm.ogg</a></span>\n</p><p>Fishing Lake soundtrack: <span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGame_Soundtrack_Fishing_Lake.ogg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/File:Game_Soundtrack_Fishing_Lake.ogg</a></span>\n</p><p>Town soundtrack: <span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGame_Soundtrack_Town.ogg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/File:Game_Soundtrack_Town.ogg</a></span>\n</p><p>Haloween Farm Soundtrack: <span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHalloween_Farm.mp3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/File:Halloween_Farm.mp3</a></span>\n</p><p>Halloween Lake Soundtrack: <span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHalloween_Lake.mp3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/File:Halloween_Lake.mp3</a></span>\n</p><p>Halloween Town Soundtrack&#160;:  <span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHalloween_Town.mp3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/File:Halloween_Town.mp3</a></span>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Loading_Screen_Birthday.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20170207184912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Birthday loading screen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Birthday loading screen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Birthday loading screen</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <i>Hay Day Birthday</i> theme comes with a different loading screen and special <a href=\"/wiki/events-7210\" title=\"Events\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">events</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Summer (June-September)</b></span></h3>\n<p>The <i>Summer</i> theme comes with a different loading screen, sunny weather, farm animals wearing themed clothes and accessories, and time-limited <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AChicken_Summer.jpg\" title=\"Chicken Summer.jpg (12 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/54/Chicken_Summer.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150804160654\" title=\"Chicken Summer.jpg (12 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chicken Summer.jpg (12 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APig_Summer.png\" title=\"Pig Summer.png (78 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a0/Pig_Summer.png/revision/latest?cb=20130711082148\" title=\"Pig Summer.png (78 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"128\" width=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Pig Summer.png (78 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"128\" width=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Summer.png\" title=\"Cow Summer.png (139 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/77/Cow_Summer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130711080938\" title=\"Cow Summer.png (139 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"184\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Summer.png (139 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"184\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASheep_Summer.jpg\" title=\"Sheep Summer.jpg (17 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/ab/Sheep_Summer.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/182?cb=20150802152747\" title=\"Sheep Summer.jpg (17 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep Summer.jpg (17 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGoat_Summer.png\" title=\"Goat Summer.png (55 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/62/Goat_Summer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20151130171956\" title=\"Goat Summer.png (55 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Goat Summer.png (55 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHoney_Bee_Summer.png\" title=\"Honey Bee Summer.png (21 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a6/Honey_Bee_Summer.png/revision/latest?cb=20160622084313\" title=\"Honey Bee Summer.png (21 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Honey Bee Summer.png (21 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Fall (September-November)</b></span></h3>\n<p>The <i>Fall</i> theme comes with foggy weather, fall grass, mushrooms, and decorative trees with fall colors.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Halloween (October)</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b0/Loading_Screen_Halloween.png/revision/latest?cb=20171021183426\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Halloween loading screen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Halloween loading screen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"156\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Halloween loading screen</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <i>Halloween</i> theme is a variation on the Fall there. It comes with a different loading screen, jack o' lanterns, farm animals wearing themed clothes and accessories, bats, three-eye river fish, a ghost in the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fishing Lake</a>, time-limited <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a> and special <a href=\"/wiki/events-7210\" title=\"Events\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">events</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHalloween_Tree.png\" title=\"Halloween Tree.png (513 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b0/Halloween_Tree.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20171022144105\" title=\"Halloween Tree.png (513 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Halloween Tree.png (513 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ABat.png\" title=\"Bat.png (79 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/ad/Bat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20171021185142\" title=\"Bat.png (79 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Bat.png (79 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AChicken_Halloween.png\" title=\"Chicken Halloween.png (37 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9f/Chicken_Halloween.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/130?cb=20141028101847\" title=\"Chicken Halloween.png (37 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"133\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chicken Halloween.png (37 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"133\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APig_Halloween_Full.png\" title=\"Pig Halloween Full.png (45 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/1a/Pig_Halloween_Full.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20141027001003\" title=\"Pig Halloween Full.png (45 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"144\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Pig Halloween Full.png (45 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"144\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Halloween.png\" title=\"Cow Halloween.png (117 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/55/Cow_Halloween.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/175?cb=20160827160331\" title=\"Cow Halloween.png (117 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Halloween.png (117 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASheep_Halloween.png\" title=\"Sheep Halloween.png (92 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/22/Sheep_Halloween.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/182?cb=20141028102135\" title=\"Sheep Halloween.png (92 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep Halloween.png (92 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGoat_Halloween.png\" title=\"Goat Halloween.png (103 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b6/Goat_Halloween.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/183?cb=20141028102317\" title=\"Goat Halloween.png (103 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Goat Halloween.png (103 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHalloween_Ghost.png\" title=\"Halloween Ghost.png (147 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9d/Halloween_Ghost.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20171024182306\" title=\"Halloween Ghost.png (147 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Halloween Ghost.png (147 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox video video-thumbnail xsmall\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHay_Day_Greg's_Halloween_Holiday_Calendar_2020_-_Day_4\" title=\"Hay Day Greg&amp;#39;s Halloween Holiday Calendar 2020 - Day 4 (29 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"></span><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/90/Hay_Day_Greg%27s_Halloween_Holiday_Calendar_2020_-_Day_4/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20201026181651\" title=\"Hay Day Greg&amp;#039;s Halloween Holiday Calendar 2020 - Day 4 (29 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Halloween calendar\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Hay Day Greg&amp;#39;s Halloween Holiday Calendar 2020 - Day 4 (29 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Halloween calendar\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"title\">Hay Day Greg's Halloween Holiday Calendar 2020 - Day 4</div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Halloween calendar</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Winter (December-February)</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3e/Loading_Screen_Winter.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20161016125349\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Winter loading screen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Winter loading screen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"140\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Winter loading screen</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <i>Winter</i> theme comes with a different loading screen, new background music, winter weather, frozen grass and ponds, farm animals and visitors wearing themed clothes and accessories, special <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-box-6452\" title=\"Mystery Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery boxes</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fishing Lake</a>, time-limited <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a> and special <a href=\"/wiki/events-7210\" title=\"Events\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">events</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AFarmhouse_Christmas.png\" title=\"Farmhouse Christ